WEBVTT

00:00:57.622 --> 00:01:00.465
instead of just learning
the household work,

00:01:00.465 --> 00:01:03.074
why not learn how to make money

00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:05.765
so that I can actually
take care of my family?

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.185
(Laughter)

00:01:07.185 --> 00:01:11.424
I knew if I had to do something different,
I would have to stay in school.

00:01:11.974 --> 00:01:13.476
But that was hard.

00:01:13.476 --> 00:01:17.466
As it was socially not accepted,
everybody was against it.

00:01:18.546 --> 00:01:21.564
But I was a stubborn young girl.

00:01:21.564 --> 00:01:24.886
I did everything I could
to continue studying,

00:01:24.886 --> 00:01:27.517
even if that meant
stitching school uniforms

00:01:27.517 --> 00:01:29.808
or making festival greeting cards.

00:01:29.808 --> 00:01:31.606
I did all that.